id: hologram-projector
name: Hologram Projector
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
tags: tech
craftDC: Expert
# "When using the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may use your Personality Modifier for
# the Damage Attribute of that Attacking Maneuver." Offered while it is worn, as the attack
# is declared; the Foundation's own is the other choice.
damageAttribute: personality
damageAttributeWhen: signature
source: Core Rule
description: >
  On a Signature Technique, Personality may be the Damage Attribute.
text: >
  Hologram Projector [Tech]: Large, comic book letters appear when you strike your opponent!
  –Craft DC: Expert
  –Effects: When using the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may use your Personality
  Modifier for the Damage Attribute of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# The Personality Modifier stands where the Foundation's Attribute would in the Wound Roll,
# and everything else the character adds to it stays. A Profile that applies the Damage
# Attribute again - Powered - applies Personality again.
